OL,3,GNEWSAPM meeting planned for parents of
OL,4,Akilled boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case is being reviewed by the
OL,7,FAttorney General's office after the
OL,8,FSlaters' MP Taiwo Owatemi referred it
OL,9,Funder the Unduly Lenient Sentence
OL,10,Fscheme, and a decision is expected next
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FOwatemi said she had secured a meeting
OL,14,Fwith the prime minister and hoped Andy
OL,15,FBurnham could hear direct from Keaton's
OL,16,Fparents.
